What:		/sys/kernel/hexagon/info/<name>
Date:		September 2026
KernelVersion:	7.3
Contact:	Brian Cain <brian.cain@oss.qualcomm.com>
Description:
		One value of the hypervisor's info call, in hex: its build id,
		boot flags, the core's revision, the TLB and cache sizes, the
		base addresses of the subsystem, interrupt controller and timer,
		the coprocessors' contexts and vector length, and so on.  The
		names are those of the info call's codes.

